    "s a verifier shall provide evidence of having been trained as assessment verifier by a recognized institution. In case of any challenge, write an email to support@tveta.go.ke 3.3.2 REGISTRATION OF AN INSTITUTION OR A BRANCH Registration of an institution or a branch/ campus shall be granted as per the provision of sections 17 to 22 of the TVET Act, 2013. The Authority accredits institutions, training programmes/courses and approves managers of private institutions. 43 TVET Accreditation Handbook",
