    "@gmail.com vi KJ-TVET The Kenya Journal of Technical and Vocational Education and Training (KJ-TVET), ISSN 2227–5088 is a peer reviewed Journal published by TVET Authority. Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority is a state corporation established by TVET Act, 2013 to regulate and coordinate Technical and Vocational Training in Kenya. The Authority was established to address evolving trends and reforms in the TVET sector and provide overall regulatory services for all TVET prov",
