    "re also expressed to authors and reviewers for working tirelessly to accomplish the work within the set timelines.’ The KJ-TVET is a journal of TVET applied research, policy and data published by Technical and Vocational Education and Training Authority. The Vol. 5 of the KJ-TVET is the second edition of the journal under Technical and Vocational Education and training Authority, the first three volumes of the journal having been published by the Rift Valley Technical Training Institute. The the",
