    "(UNESCO- UNEVOC, 2009). Indeed, TVET is a powerful tool for the rapid advancement of technologies, citizen capacities, economic growth in economies and national development (Akhuemonkhan and Raimi, 2013). Statement of the Problem As a new approach to training in most TVET institutions, online training is becoming a more popular mode of training for learners as they can combine their learning experience with the continuous advancement of information technology. Despite the claims that online lear",
