    "arning experience. Addition- ally, Mwenda et al., (2019) demonstrated that AI can help trainers in creating customized instructional materials using NLP algorithms. Research Objectives The main objective of this study was to examine the adoption of AI in TVET institutions in Kenya. The specific objectives were to: i. Establish the education level of teaching staff in TVET institutions in Kenya. ii. Determine the status of ICT equipment and infrastructure in supporting the adoption of AI in TVET",
