    "Devices in Implementation of AI Technology in TVET institutions in Kenya. v. Establish the relationship between computer devices, staffing levels, and academic qualifications of teaching staff in supporting the adoption of AI in TVET Institutions in Kenya. Methodology A survey of 204 public TVET institutions was undertaken across all the 47 County Governments. An online questionnaire was used to collect data from the targeted institutions through the Sogolytics platform. Predefined Excel templat",
