    "igital skills. TVET institutions in developed countries are playing the role of integrating flexible learning pathways with AI directly used by education and training institutions. According to Adams (2023), some TVET institutions in developed countries have already succeeded in embedding AI in various contexts, including legislation, policy, and sectors such as education and the national economy. As a result, TVET institutions in developed countries is playing a role in integrating flexible lea",
