    "interconnected. Participants suggested that resilience within female-led MSMEs is therefore intimately linked to resilience within households and thus participants identified that a key route to enabling private sector adaptation among female-led MSMEs, is to build resilience at the household level. Yet they felt this relationship is often overlooked and poorly understood by policy makers. Participants reported that women’s access to entrepreneurship and adaptation resources, such as land, capit",
