    "es, display advertising screens and other digital media. Online marketing is the catching of the attention of potential customers for business through ban- ners, articles, videos, flash animation images etc. Follow-up publicity is an excellent way to present products to customers using digital platforms (Saura, 2020). Branding is the creation of a strategic process of notifying potential customers what a business is all about. A brand distils everything about what a business does into a unique,",
