    "e aim to grow a brand on the digital space (Jeandri et al., 2019). Digital branding is not the same as digital marketing. Digital marketing aims at getting more consu- mers of a product to generate more revenue for a business whereas digital branding creates value and encourages loyalty and brand awareness. A brand is how the audience perceive a certain business; branding promotes user connections that help a business speak directly to 102 Digital Skills and Use of Digital Platforms: A Case Stud",
