    "anufacturing sector................................. 12 4 1. INTRODUCTION In recent years, the dynamics of labor demand in Kenya's agriculture and manufacturing sectors have become a critical focus for policymakers, job seekers and other players in the labour market. Understanding these dynamics is essential for developing effective strategies to enhance employment opportunities and stimulate economic growth. This report presents a quarterly analysis of labor demand within these sectors, utilizi",
