    "ying a large portion of the population. Similarly, the manufacturing sector is critical in driving industrialization and economic diversification. By analyzing labor demand trends, this report seeks to provide insights into the workforce needs and emerging employment patterns in these sectors. The report assesses Labor market trends by analyzing job advertisements and identifying the key employability skills in demand. Sectoral Analysis is also outlined in this report by comparing labour demand",
